id: pmc-sdk-completeness-1025
title: Use the pm SDK for whole-tracker completeness validation
description: Replace duplicate completeness diagnostics from the 2026-10-25 audit with inspectCompleteListResult and certifyCompleteListResult; prove compatibility on non-git public-tracker copies.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
